  "measures": [
    {
      "name": "Kirkwood Community College Public Measure NC",
      "jurisdiction": "Kirkwood Community College (Merged Area X) - Poweshiek County portion",
      "ballotLanguage": "Shall the following public measure be adopted? \"Shall Kirkwood Community College (Merged Area X) in the Counties of Benton, Black Hawk, Buchanan, Cedar, Clinton, Delaware, Dubuque, Iowa, Jackson, Jefferson, Johnson, Jones, Keokuk, Linn, Louisa, Poweshiek, Tama, and Washington, be authorized to renovate, improve, erect, and equip facilities to modernize learning spaces with an emphasis on health sciences, industrial technologies, agricultural sciences, and business and information technology, contract indebtedness therefor, and issue General Obligation Bonds in an amount not exceeding $88,000,000 for those purposes?\""
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Supervisors elected AT-LARGE (Board of Supervisor, vote for no more than two, on every ballot style). All 33 official sample ballot styles parsed and cross-checked against the county candidate list. Township trustee/clerk races are vote-for-one; Sheridan, Pleasant and Union Twp trustee/clerk have no printed candidates (write-in). Kirkwood Community College (Merged Area X) bond measure appears only on precincts within Kirkwood (styles 0211K, 0213K, 0221K, 0304K, 0312K, 02VI/02HA, 03DR). No county hospital trustee race on ballot."
